        "isCorrect": true,
        "distractorType": null,
        "distractorDisplayName": null,
        "analysis": "【正确项 · 同义归纳】P4-S3 连用排比描述唱片的巨大优势：cheap（廉价）、available everywhere（随处可得）、can be consumed at a time and place of choosing（随时随地消费）。这正是 easily accessible to the general public 的完美概括。",
